1
00:00:06,131 --> 00:00:09,571
(Raj:)These spring rolls are amazing.
Good job, Bernadette.

2
00:00:10,001 --> 00:00:12,491
(Bernadette:)That's the takeout that Sheldon brought.

3
00:00:15,173 --> 00:00:20,013
(Raj:)I'm sure they wouldn't have tasted nearly as
good if I hadn't tried your food first.

4
00:00:24,282 --> 00:00:28,652
(Sheldon:)Howard, did you want your clothes
arranged seasonally or by color?

5
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:31,610
- Color's fine.
- Wrong, they'll be arranged seasonally.

6
00:00:33,158 --> 00:00:35,488
(Penny:)Aren't you gonna spend
a little time with Amy?

7
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,090
(Amy:)Oh, it's okay, I'm used to it.

8
00:00:37,262 --> 00:00:41,662
(Amy:)The other day at Whole Foods, he spent
an hour optimizing the cheese aisle.

9
00:00:41,833 --> 00:00:42,963
(Sheldon:)And some thanks I got.

10
00:00:43,134 --> 00:00:46,534
(Sheldon:)The assistant manager chased me out
with an artisanal salami.

11
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:51,040
(Amy:)His quirks just make you love him more.

12
00:00:53,278 --> 00:00:54,708
(Amy:)Someone please agree with me.

13
00:01:00,818 --> 00:01:02,808
(Leonard:)Come on. It's getting late. Time to go.

